. *------------------------------------------------------------
. * HOUSEHOLD-LEVEL RESULTS (expenditures)
. * Store estimates and export clean tables focused on Progresa effects
. *------------------------------------------------------------
. 
. eststo clear

. drop if year==97
(24,077 observations deleted)

